# Peroxidase-like activity of Ni-hemin MOFs

To demonstrate that Ni-hemin MOFs is an ideal biomimetic catalyst, we evaluated the peroxidase-like activity of Ni-hemin MOFs by catalytic oxidation of the common peroxidase substrate, TMB, in the presence of
